  "prefLabel": "He-M 526.04 Establishment of a State DRF",
  "priorExpiration": "2016-01-03",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-M 526.04 Establishment of a State DRF. If the commissioner establishes a state-operated program as a DRF that has the administrative supports, clinical services, and security measures to meet the needs of individuals served in the facility, such DRF shall comply with the applicable provisions of He-M 526 through He-M 529.\n\nSource. #6213, eff 3-30-96, EXPIRED: 12-31-98\n\nNew. #7089, eff 8-31-99, EXPIRED: 8-31-07\n\nNew. #9059, eff 1-3-08, EXPIRED: 1-3-16\n\nNew. #11125, eff 7-1-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-m500.html"
